            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cooking 101"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We love potato salad and though we have our favorites are always on the look out for something new. This was pretty good, but I would go with dill pickle or relish in place of the cucumber for a little added flavor. Also, I like to add a little paprika for the color. I think I would also use a red onion or green onions just because the yellow onion I used was really potent, could be I added a little to much, but the onion flavor was very strong. Thanks so much for sharing."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ShiponFawn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used Yukon Gold potatoes and regular Mayo and omitted cucumber, celery, tomato and diced onion. Substituted spicy pickles and spicy brown mustard for some added kick and added crumbled bacon and smoked paprika at time of serving. Hard boiled eggs prepared in advance. Served with pulled pork BBQ. Excellent flavor! Rave reviews from guests.",
            "datePublished": "2020-11-02T01:46:20.307Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "angelinamarie3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I scaled this down, for smaller portions. It was great, minus an ingredient or two. It really HAS to be tweaked. Cucumber is interesting, but I prefer pickles or relish. More flavor than a tasteless cucumber. I substituted pimentos for tomatoes. Do not prefer celery- omitted that. And used all diced onion instead of green onions. Good recipe, but I think some things need to be adjusted or replaced.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-06T03:45:10.067Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "stayin' afloat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it. Followed what other reviews recommended (replaced cucumber with dill pickles, used red onion. I also added an additional potato and egg), and my picky husband loved it. We ate it freshly warm and chilled --- both were delicious. The fresh vegetables added a nice crunch to it.",
            "datePublished": "2014-08-06T12:49:53.203Z"
          },
          {
